  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det g&#xe4;ller st&#xe4;rkande av kapaciteten hos ministeriet f&#xf6;r M&#xe4;nskliga  R&#xe4;ttigheter, samt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Roma-integrationsprojekt  p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5; som pilotprojekt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the 1 year OSCE Inception Programme and the  3 year MHMR Programme is to contribute to better inclusion of Roma    into Serbian society, through the strengthening of the MHMR           capacities in the implementation of its mandate in leading, according to PBA approach, the institutional reforms required to introduce new  and efficient systems of monitoring, coordination and reporting.</narrative>
  </description>
